/E (The TRIBOULET robot, representing the Medieval era, uses the same communication architecture as EDGY. It is controlled by a LEGO EV3 running MicroPython, connected to a micro:bit through serial communication. The micro:bit acts as a BLE bridge, allowing TRIBOULET to send and receive signals from the other systems and activate only at the specific moments required by the story.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [135]
