/E (Chrono Map allows ALL-IN to understand where it is during the performance. The colored markings on the floor work as location tags, and the robot uses its sensors to identify each one. When ALL-IN detects a specific color, it recognizes its position on the stage and uses that information to understand the current part of the journey and decide what action should happen next.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [164]
>>
endobj
